  "body": "Perched high with stunning views over Rangitoto Island and the Hauraki Gulf, Waiake Rise offers eight brand-new, architecturally designed homes - and only one two-level house \r\n\r\n4 Bedrooms + 3 Bathrooms (including master suite) . bosch appliance \r\nThis home features light-filled open-plan living, premium finishes, and a warm, contemporary design. Built by a well-established construction company in collaboration with two highly respected architectural firms, ensuring top-tier quality and craftsmanship.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love It:\r\n\r\n10-minute walk to beautiful Waiake Beach in Torbay\r\n\r\nClose to shops, parks, schools, and public transport\r\n\r\nShort drive to motorway access for city convenience\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed with fitted wardrobes and statement lighting\r\n\r\nMove-in ready - everything is done for you",
